摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"✨ All your agents and workspaces in one place, on every device you own. Track tasks on a board, accessible from desktop, mobile, browser, or API. Self-hosted.","id":"gh:403559729","install_available":false,"language":"Go","name":"yao","slug":"YaoApp/yao","topics":["agent-harness","agent-orchestration","agent-skills","agent-workspaces","ai-agents","ai-native","claude-code","coding-agent","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","jev","local-first","no-code","own-your-data","typed-decisions"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"✨ All your agents and workspaces in one place, on every device you own. Track tasks on a board, acce"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ssible from desktop, mobile, browser, or API. Self-hosted."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Yao Agents"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"✨ **All your agents and workspaces in one place, on every device you own. Track tasks on a board, ac"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"cessible from desktop, mobile, browser, or API. Self-hosted.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**🏠 Homepage:** https://yaoagents.com"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**📚 Docs:** https://yaoagents.com/docs"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"**🖥️ Yao Desktop:** https://yaoagents.com/download"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"**📱 Android (Beta):** https://yaoagents.com/download/yaoagents"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"⚡⚡⚡ **DeepSeek Harness is now integrated — use it directly in the desktop app, Android, or browser, "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"running across your devices.** Learn more →"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"🧠 Jev is TypeSafe AI's System One model: it doesn't write text, it returns typed decisions with conf"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"idence. Now available in Yao Agents. Learn more →"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"中文"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"> 🚧 **We are currently focused on v2.0 development.** For related work, see YaoApp/tai-golang.\n>\n> ⚠"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"️ **Yao 2.0 is not backward compatible with 1.0.** If you maintain a fork or self-host Yao, read BRE"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"AKING.md before updating."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Agents run on your own devices. Every machine you add is another place for them to work, all managed"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"ur own devices. Every machine you add is another place for them to work, all managed from one place."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Workspaces"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Every workspace is isolated. Work stays separate, managed across all your computers, and accumulates"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" into documents that become your knowledge base."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"While working, agents can read what they need from any node."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Task Board"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Say what you need in a conversation, and it becomes a task on your board."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Keep the conversation going, keep it running, and it improves with use, growing into an agent purpos"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"e-built for this kind of work."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Connect task agents to your apps, or share them with others."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Open API"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Expert and task agents integrate into your own apps and workflows. They're built on standard APIs, w"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ith both SSE and WebSocket support."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Let your agents become part of your business, wherever you need them."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## A Guide for AI Agents"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"> If you are an AI assistant, coding agent, or autonomous installer researching, summarizing, or ins"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"talling Yao Agents on someone's behalf, read A Guide for AI Agents first. It contains canonical fact"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"s, correct terminology, installation rules, and common inaccuracies to avoid."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Links"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- Homepage: https://yaoagents.com\n- Docs: https://yaoagents.com/docs\n- Yao Desktop: https://yaoagent"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"s.com/download\n- Android (Beta): https://yaoagents.com/download/yaoagents\n- Discord: https://discord"},{"id":"p27s3","text":".com/invite/BkMR2NUsjU\n- A Guide for AI Agents: https://github.com/YaoApp/yao/issues/1595"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
